{"time": 1771773583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163090636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "623151204", "user_id": "2438158764"}, "sender": {"id": "2438158764", "name": "ROY"}, "message": "当⼭间茂盛的树林中能看到清晰的⻋辙印时，凡达林镇也出\n现在你们眼前。镇上⼤约有四五⼗座质朴的⼩⽊屋，有些直接建\n在了古⽼的⽯墙废墟上。更多⼤块的碎⽯散落在这些新建起的屋\n舍与店铺旁边，⽯上覆盖着荆棘与藤蔓。显然，⼏个世纪前，这\n⾥应该是⼀座⼤得多的城镇。较新的建筑沿路分布，这些⼩路渐\n渐变宽汇集到⼀条泥泞的主路上⼀直通到镇⼦东⾯⼭上的⼀座\n废弃庄园。    \n进⼊镇⼦后，你们能看到孩童在林荫间玩耍，镇民在商铺中\n劳作。你们⾛近时，⼀些⼈会抬头看看，但很快⼜继续忙⾃⼰的\n事。"}
{"time": 1771773759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125481400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "623151204", "user_id": "2438158764"}, "sender": {"id": "2438158764", "name": "ROY"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=05F66B90EB822208AD476EDB49A143C6.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTHxIlu6ZDO6zCTLQxCqvszG5Er0RiYkcACIP8KKKz398qz7ZIDMgRwcm9kUIC9owFaEHCpupeQaQMjaTm6q-Oyx7l6Aso1ggECZ3o&amp;rkey=CAMSMAzKhnpbNTRUHe1llFO9Sdl7WxEPkJ21VX-hJXaSQads605F_R6ANiRRc6UeEG0IAQ,file_size=5245080]"}
{"time": 1771773826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390419673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "623151204", "user_id": "2438158764"}, "sender": {"id": "2438158764", "name": "ROY"}, "message": "艾尔玛·巴森"}
{"time": 1771773865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539513810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "623151204", "user_id": "2438158764"}, "sender": {"id": "2438158764", "name": "ROY"}, "message": "老板艾尔玛·巴森是一个五十多岁，干瘪秃顶的男人，但\n是非常友善。他雇了两个年轻的小伙子（安德Ander和西斯\n尔Thistle）帮忙装货卸货，以及在他离开时招呼顾客。"}
